Z||000016||fieroshop||06-07-2000||02:08 AM||||Well guysit's llike this. I will make a mold and sell (with instrutions and measurements) the parts needed to convert your own hood, I will also sell hoods complete with scoop and grills in grey primer state or I can even paint them for you in the same color as you Fiero. As far as price I have not figured it out yet and I won't have time until after the wertern regiomal in San Diego, we also have our show when we have our second annual poker run this coming Sunday. I am the one in charge of the run and I have my hands full doing the trophies and the run and have to get food for Sunday as well. Any of you coming. Let me know asap. Thanks||||reg||7
